## Tools

The versions pinned in the Framework's `package.json` and `package-lock.json`:
TypeScript 6.0.3 (typescript-eslint 8.71.0 supports `<6.1.0`, so not 7.x),
ESLint 10.11.0, @eslint/js 10.0.1, typescript-eslint 8.71.0, Prettier 3.9.9,
vitest 5.0.3, @types/node 24.19.1, aws-cdk-lib 2.273.0, constructs 10.8.1,
aws-cdk (the CLI) 2.1145.0, cdk-nag 3.0.2, tsx 4.23.15. In `src/go.mod` and
`src/go.sum`: Go 1.26, github.com/aws/aws-lambda-go 1.55.1,
github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2 1.47.3, its `config` 1.33.9 and
`service/dynamodb` 1.70.3. golangci-lint is the runner's (v2.14). The
`Makefile` runs cfn-lint 1.57.2 with uv. The CDK Nag rules these docs name
were read from cdk-nag 3.0.2's `RULES.md`, and `cdk.json`'s feature flags are
the ones `cdk init` of aws-cdk 2.1145.0 writes.
{{- else -}}
